          "quote": "很多人会觉得吃药会“变笨”，其实这是药物早期可能出现的轻度困倦、反应变慢"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00191",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly separates the experience of side effects from the idea of being controlled, and frames it as a medical concern rather than a dispute.",
          "quote": "就说「去跟医生调一下出院的药，顺便问问吃了药头晕、睡不好这些不舒服」"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
