        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00333",
          "explanation": "Doctor encourages the family to describe the patient's specific words ('变笨') rather than just labeling her as non-adherent.",
          "quote": "说“吃了脑子会慢”“你们就是想管我”"
